WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:02.535
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers,
and this is "Late Night.

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:03.836
We hope everybody
is doing well tonight.

00:00:03.836 --> 00:00:05.371
And now let's get to the news.

00:00:05.371 --> 00:00:07.907
Russian President Vladimir Putin
yesterday

00:00:07.907 --> 00:00:11.644
ordered troops into separatist
regions of eastern Ukraine

00:00:11.644 --> 00:00:13.780
and said they were
"peacekeepers."

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:16.950
Specifically,
they're keeping this piece.

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:19.619
[ Laughter ]

00:00:19.619 --> 00:00:22.321
President Biden is set
to impose sanctions

00:00:22.321 --> 00:00:24.691
after Putin ordered troops
into Ukraine.

00:00:24.691 --> 00:00:28.561
From now on, Russia doesn't
get the new Wordle until noon.

00:00:28.561 --> 00:00:30.663
[ Laughter ]

00:00:30.663 --> 00:00:32.064
It's very easy.

00:00:32.064 --> 00:00:35.635
Russian Wordle's very easy,
'cause it's always "Putin."

00:00:35.635 --> 00:00:38.171
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.841 --> 00:00:44.777
Senate Judiciary chair
Dick Durbin said yesterday

00:00:44.777 --> 00:00:45.911
that his first call

00:00:45.911 --> 00:00:47.813
when Supreme Court justice
Stephen Breyer

00:00:47.813 --> 00:00:49.182
announced his retirement

00:00:49.182 --> 00:00:52.151
was to his committee's
top Republican, Chuck Grassley.

00:00:52.151 --> 00:00:54.621
And Grassley's first call
was to,

00:00:54.621 --> 00:00:57.457
I don't know,
Alexander Graham Bell?

00:00:57.457 --> 00:00:59.292
[ Laughter ]

00:00:59.292 --> 00:01:01.060
According to the latest numbers,

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:04.029
more than half of unemployed
American men in their 30s

00:01:04.029 --> 00:01:05.398
have criminal records.

00:01:05.398 --> 00:01:07.066
Also vinyl ones.

00:01:07.066 --> 00:01:09.636
[ Laughter ]

00:01:09.636 --> 00:01:12.605
The social-media platform
Snapchat

00:01:12.605 --> 00:01:14.206
unveiled a new feature last week

00:01:14.206 --> 00:01:17.744
that allows users to share their
real-time location with friends.

00:01:17.744 --> 00:01:19.345
You can learn more about it

00:01:19.345 --> 00:01:21.614
in an upcoming episode
of "Dateline."

00:01:21.614 --> 00:01:23.649
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.649 --> 00:01:27.820
"Snapchat wasn't the only thing
that disappeared that day."

00:01:27.820 --> 00:01:30.289
[ Laughter ]

00:01:30.289 --> 00:01:32.525
A passable Keith Morrison.

00:01:32.525 --> 00:01:33.726
[ Laughter ]

00:01:33.726 --> 00:01:35.594
According to a new survey,

00:01:35.594 --> 00:01:39.265
59% of Americans prefer
for toilet paper to be hung

00:01:39.265 --> 00:01:42.101
so that the next sheet
comes from over the roll.

00:01:42.101 --> 00:01:47.574
And somehow that 59% are all
married to the other 41%.

00:01:47.574 --> 00:01:49.975
[ Laughter ]

00:01:49.975 --> 00:01:52.979
"The New York Times" published
an op-ed yesterday titled

00:01:52.979 --> 00:01:56.482
"Ignoring a Text Message
or E-mail Isn't Always Rude.

00:01:56.482 --> 00:01:58.217
Sometimes It's Necessary."

00:01:58.217 --> 00:02:01.654
And I think I speak for everyone
when I say, "K."

00:02:01.654 --> 00:02:03.923
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.391 --> 00:02:07.460
And finally,
according to a new survey,

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:10.429
40% of Americans said that they
don't enjoy gossiping at all

00:02:10.429 --> 00:02:12.098
and then added,
"But you know who does?

00:02:12.098 --> 00:02:15.501
Jessica, Jessica."

00:02:15.501 --> 00:02:17.403
[ Laughter ]

00:02:17.403 --> 00:02:19.472
And, oh, that's some
really good gossip.

00:02:19.472 --> 00:02:21.607
Look at them.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.607 --> 00:02:23.609
If somebody is whispering
in your ear,

00:02:23.609 --> 00:02:24.844
you can't make that face.

00:02:24.844 --> 00:02:26.045
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.045 --> 00:02:28.414
It's like, "I have a secret."
It's like...

00:02:28.414 --> 00:02:29.915
Like, you can't do that
at a barbecue.

00:02:29.915 --> 00:02:31.951
And then everyone's like, "What
were you guys talking about?"

00:02:31.951 --> 00:02:34.087
"Um, the potato salad."

